  "ruleText": "Agr 4003.03 Submitting an Application. The applicant shall mail a completed application and all attachments, in accordance with the deadlines established in Agr 4003.02 to:\n\nDepartment of Agriculture, Markets, & Food\n\nOffice of the Commissioner\n\nPO Box 2042, Concord, NH, 03302 -2042.\n\nSource. #13816, eff 12-1-23",
